# Evidence integrity: artifacts are hash-pinned by manifest.sha256.json
# (SHA-256 over the exact bytes produced at run time — all LF, writers use
# newline="\n").  Any line-ending conversion on checkout changes the bytes
# and breaks verification.  The previous rule `artifacts/** text eol=crlf`
# forced LF->CRLF on fresh clones and caused "sha256 mismatch" (verified
# experimentally on 2026-09-09).  -text disables all conversion so every
# clone is byte-identical to the hashed evidence.
* text=auto
artifacts/** -text
*.png binary
